--- !u!1001 &213725548
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1927697526}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 4821288827690802275, guid: 50bc0bea6630cf24ab7af7dd3a02036a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_PresetInfoIsWorld
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4821325795680570595, guid: 50bc0bea6630cf24ab7af7dd3a02036a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Info
      value: 'A bear got into the beehive to steal honey. The beekeeper didn''t know
        what to do anymore. He would only take his gun, and the bear would immediately
        climb a tree, out of reach.



        Well, he saw an ad in the newspaper:
        "I can help with any kind of animal." He called that specialist, and in an
        hour, a huge guy arrived with a gun and a little dachshund.



        He
        introduced his little friend:



        This is Snowball, he''ll help us
        a lot.

        And they went to the beehive with the bear. As soon as the
        bear saw them, he climbed a tree. The guy handed the beekeeper the gun and
        explained:



        I''ll climb the tree and drop the bear, and Snowball
        will get into his ass and tear him apart. Got it?

        I got it. But
        what''s the gun for?

        If I fall down before him, shoot Snowball.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4821325795680570595, guid: 50bc0bea6630cf24ab7af7dd3a02036a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Title
      value: "Ay\u0131 ve k\xF6pek Kar top"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
